    "en": "The war between clans is over. The island is yours Turn a massive island into a thriving resort empire. Explore, survive, manage and trade in a world full of opportunity and danger Guests arrive with expectations and coins to spend. Hunt, farm and produce to keep your island running. Every decoration increases comfort, value and profit. Unlock new areas and expand your services and resort empire. A world that feels truly alive. Some visitors will test your judgment. Discover hidden areas, resources and new opportunities. “War’s broken pirates fiercer than you’ll ever be. And peace? Peace has lined the pockets of men who had nothin’.” -Captain Old Salt"
